# arXiv source: the .tex and SOURCE_MANIFEST.json are the formula authority and
# ARE tracked. The figures are not -- they are tens of MB of PDF/PNG and are
# regenerable from the .gz archives beside them, which are tracked and hashed.
docs/paper/*_source/**/*.pdf
docs/paper/*_source/**/*.png
docs/paper/*_source/**/*.jpg
docs/paper/*_source/**/*.eps
graphify-out/

